  is only open to current Duke faculty\, staff\, and students. Attending t
 his event fulfills the <b>RCR-200</b> requirement for Faculty and Staff a
 s well as the <b>714 RCR credit</b> for graduate students\, but participa
 nts must attend for at least 60 minutes to receive credit.
