CREATED:20260422T210538Z
DESCRIPTION:In this seminar\, participants will learn about the structure 
 and organization of medical record data\, and use the Duke FCAP system to
  query data and gain hands-on experience with the platform.\nThe Duke Fed
 erated Clinical Analytics Platform (FCAP) is a secure and protected envir
 onment allowing access to de-identified medical record data.\nThe seminar
  will be at an introductory level with foundational concepts around how p
 atient medical record data are structured. Participants will also engage 
 with hands-on exercises to construct FCAP queries for insights using medi
 cal record data.\nThis event is hosted by North Carolina Central Universi
 ty (NCCU)\, the Duke Clinical and Translational Science Institute (CTSI)\
 , the Duke-NCCU Bridge Office\, and the Duke AI Health Community of Pract
 ice. Light refreshments will be served.
